KEY POINTS TO REMEMBER:

1. AI offers many opportunities in modern technology and in a fast-growing job market!

2. AI professionals are needed across industries, like financial services, weather prediction,
    healthcare, and advanced robotics. 

3. Consider exploring job roles that use AI skills, such as:
    -> Machine learning engineer
    -> Machine learning scientist
    -> Software engineer
    -> Research engineer
    -> Robotic scientist
    -> Data scientist
    -> Business intelligence developer
    -> Algorithm specialist
    -> Natural language processing (NLP) engineer

4. The core skills you should have include a knowledge of data science and the ability to code in
    several programming languages.

5. Different job roles within the AI field have different requirements and can provide rewarding
    work on different aspects of artificial intelligence.